description:
Add share buttons in the Share tab for unlisted/public projects.

In ShareTab.jsx:
- Add share buttons below the URL/embed section:
  - Twitter/X: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url={url}&text={title}
  - Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u={url}
  - LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url={url}
  - WhatsApp: https://wa.me/?text={title} {url}
- Use Web Share API as primary (navigator.share) with fallback to platform URLs
- Simple icon buttons in a row
